sequenceDiagram
  participant Sensor
  participant ML
  participant Rules
  participant Room
  participant Cloud
  participant Actuator
  participant BLE
  participant UI
  Sensor->>ML: window of 20 samples
  ML-->>Rules: class and confidence
  Sensor-->>Rules: axes and intensity
