  Sensor->>Cloud: enqueue monitoring snapshot
  Rules->>Rules: consecutive matches, edge, cooldown
  par side effects
    Rules->>Actuator: request pulse
    Rules->>BLE: send ALERT
    Rules->>Room: save execution with actual result
  end
  Room-->>UI: recent records and executions
  Cloud-->>UI: sync state
  BLE-->>UI: connection and acknowledgement
